===Speak with Acheron{{subst:void|<!--103410901-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Dreamflux Reef|Finally, the trailblazing expedition on Penacony has come to a preferable conclusion. It's time for a new adventure &mdash; but before that, the Crew would like to wish say a formal farewell to certain people.<br />Drawing a firm line under the stories of those who passed is the best form of comfort. Go on, then &mdash; they're all at the Dreamflux Reef... right here.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Acheron:''' When I arrived, I happened to see a child holding it. He said the flowers were prepared by Aunt Jessie, for the Watchmaker, and the war comrade he'd missed his whole life.
:'''Acheron:''' Mikhail would place two bunches of flowers here year after year. And, after he left, it became three.
:'''Acheron:''' Your wishes will always be remembered by someone.
:'''Acheron:''' Now, Penacony as you hoped, has welcomed the dawn after a long, dark night. The path forward may not be a bed of roses, but at least people are prepared to step forth towards freedom.
:'''Acheron:''' Tiernan, you can go home now.
:'''Acheron:''' While the Nameless are also preparing for the next stop of their voyage.
:'''Himeko:''' But before leaving, we still have one last thing to do.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} To say goodbye to you.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We've come to say goodbye to Gallagher.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We've come to say goodbye to the old Nameless.
:{{tx}}
:{{tx}}

;(Talk to Acheron)
:'''Acheron:''' A fitting end to the tale of the departed &mdash; one could not ask for a better farewell. Go on, they're all here.
{{Dialogue End}}

